error[SE0325]: a setting may not be a buffer
 --> tests/emit/lib/bufbad/BufBad.se:8:22
  |
8 |     settings { blob: buffer(8); }                 // SE0325: a setting
  |                      ^^^^^^ a buffer
  = note: a setting's value is a §7 expression, and §7 is a language of numbers with dimensions
  = note: a buffer goes on an input, an output or a var (§5.1a)

