10 |     outputs  { q: buffer; }                       // SE0323: storage with none
   |                   ^^^^^^ storage needs a size
   = note: a leaf's output is the wire's storage and a var is the node's own, so each holds the bytes and says how many it can (§5.1a)
   = help: write `q: buffer(1500);` with the largest payload it must hold

